// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_pua_webbrowserpassview.yml
// ID Sigma: d0dae994-26c6-4d2d-83b5-b3c8b79ae513
// Título: PUA - WebBrowserPassView Execution
// Descripción: Detects the execution of WebBrowserPassView.exe. A password recovery tool that reveals the passwords stored by the following Web browsers, Internet Explorer (Version 4.0 - 11.0), Mozilla Firefox (All Versions), Google Chrome, Safari, and Opera
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_pua_webbrowserpassview.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessVersionInfoFileDescription =~ "Web Browser Password Viewer" or FolderPath endswith "\\WebBrowserPassView.exe"
